  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9bc9f25f81cda534688795db34d0161c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SignalLost.Runtime::SignalLost.Interactables.NpcDialogueInteractable
  interactionPrompt: '[E] Interact'
  speakerName: Dr. Reyes
  briefing: You made it. The mainframe turned every sentry on the island against
    us. Restore the central radio beacon and get to the extraction boat before lockdown
    seals the island. The armory keypad code is 4471. Take the Arc Pistol.
  repeatDialogue: Three override fuses are still out there. Bunkers A and B have
    two. The old maintenance cache beneath the radio tower has the third. Keep moving.
